## §5 Integration with DVSM Supervisor (Minimal Edits)

### §5.1 Edit 1: DVSM_IMPL.md §11.5 (Add Function Hook)

**Location:** After §11 (Runtime Profiles)

**Code:**

```rust
/// §11.5 SAEC Compression Hook (Adaptive, Singularity-Driven)
/// Called from async compression worker after observation capture
pub fn compress_observation_frame_adaptive(
    state: &DVSMState,
    config: &SessionConfig,
    observation: &[f32],
    width: usize,
    height: usize,
    rose_net: Option<&RoseNeuralNet>,
) -> Result<Vec<u8>, String> {
    // Kill-switch check
    if config.compression_enabled == 0 {
        return Ok(raw_observation_bytes(observation));
    }
    
    // 1. Extract phase_delta from PLL state
    let phase_delta_q = state.phase_delta_q
        .ok_or("Phase-lock state not available")?;
    
    // 2. Compute adaptive config from singularity
    let mut encoder = SAECEncoderAdaptive::new(phase_delta_q);
    
    // 3. Encode observation frame (tile-based)
    encode_observation_frame_adaptive(
        &mut encoder,
        observation,
        width,
        height,
    )?;
    
    Ok(encoder.output.flush())
}
```

**Size:** ~35 lines

