### §5.3 Edit 3: Supervisor Loop (Async Worker Thread)

**Pseudocode (in game loop / supervisor):**

```rust
// Thread 1: DVSM Supervisor (120 Hz, critical path)
loop {
    // PLL tick (0.25ms)
    tick_phase_locked(&mut state, &config, &profile, ...)?;
    
    // Enqueue compression job (async, fire-and-forget)
    compression_queue.enqueue(CompressionJob {
        observation: capture_frame_data(),
        state_snapshot: state.clone_for_compression(),
        width: 1920,
        height: 1080,
        frame_idx: frame_counter,
    });
    
    frame_counter += 1;
}

// Thread 2: Compression Worker (Independent, asynchronous)
loop {
    if let Some(job) = compression_queue.dequeue() {
        let compressed = compress_observation_frame_adaptive(
            &job.state_snapshot,
            &config,
            &job.observation,
            job.width,
            job.height,
            rose_net.as_ref(),
        )?;
        
        network_output.send(compressed)?;
    } else {
        std::thread::sleep(Duration::from_micros(100));
    }
}
```

**Critical Path (Thread 1):** 0.27 ms (unchanged)  
**Compression Path (Thread 2):** 0.6 ms asynchronous (not blocking PLL)

